---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Refund & Cancellation Policy - Rehman Veterinary Clinic</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Refund and cancellation policy for appointments and pharmacy purchases at Rehman Veterinary Clinic." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans selection:bg-emerald-200 selection:text-emerald-900">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Appointment Cancellations</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We understand that plans change. You may cancel your booked home visit or clinic consultation completely free of charge up to <strong>2 hours</strong> before the scheduled appointment time. For late cancellations or no-shows, a nominal booking fee may be applied to your next visit to compensate for the blocked schedule.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Veterinary Services & Consultations</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Payments for veterinary services (consultations, video triage, home visits, surgeries) are processed after the service is rendered. Due to the medical nature of these services, consultation fees and service charges are <strong>non-refundable</strong> once the veterinarian has performed the examination or triage.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Pharmacy & Pet Shop Purchases</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">For items purchased through our physical clinic or website shop (such as cat food, milk replacers, and accessories):</p>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4">
        <li>Unopened and untampered products in their original packaging can be returned or exchanged within <strong>3 days</strong> of purchase.</li>
        <li><strong>Medications, vaccines, and prescription items are strictly non-returnable and non-refundable</strong> once they have left the clinic premises due to safety, hygiene, and storage temperature requirements.</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Process for Refunds</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">If an eligible product return is accepted, refunds will be processed in cash or via bank transfer/EasyPaisa within 3-5 business days. Please contact our helpline at +92 311 4899904 to initiate a return request.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
